 for review: consolidated held-out oracle (24 tests: happy+8 edge/E2E) GREEN; 2 mutations caught (union->replace glob, string-token iteration); lint+typecheck clean; 651 code-review-related tests pass. Commit 5a25b28d05 (Change-Id I8b675c…), pushed Gerrit change https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1959. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before close.","timestamp":1787254614134199001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 (cfdb) authored code-review-concurrency.md overlay prompt (concurrency-model gate + unlocked-twin/lockset + race quartet + disposition-aware guard suppression + defer-by-name). Structural greps all pass; reviewer prompt-loader suite 36 passed; lint clean. Commit c151a91605, pushed Gerrit change 1960 stacked on 1959. S2/S4/S5 remain dep-blocked until S1(1959)+S3(1960) reach Verified+1 and close.","timestamp":1787254784596003001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 (1960) CI Verified-1: 2 frontmatter-canonicalization tests failed (test_prompt_front_matter round-trip + test_code_review_ws2 fixed-point) — my -k reviewer preflight filter missed them. Non-behavioral fix: round-tripped code-review-concurrency.md frontmatter through write_front_matter. 197 prompt/front-matter tests now pass; structural ACs intact. Amended (Change-Id I8fc58b…), re-pushed patchset 2. S1 LLM-Review+1 already in; S1 Verified still running.","timestamp":1787256573728174001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 (054b) CLOSED: change 1959 LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1; checked all 5 AC boxes; completion-verifier close gate PASSED. S2 not yet unblocked (also needs S3).","timestamp":1787257039749420001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 (cfdb) CLOSED: PS2 Verified+1 (run 32412543206 success) AND LLM-Review+1; the earlier cli-reference-stale CI failure was a DIFFERENT concurrent change, not mine (confirmed via change 1960 messages: PS2 authoritative run was 32412543206). regenerate-index correctly produces no entry (prompt inert until S2 registers it). AC boxes checked; completion-verifier PASSED. Unblocked S2(bd21)+S4(c134). Next: S2 registration (code leaf, held-out TDD).","timestamp":1787259251321265001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 register-concurrency-overlay: held-out validated (32 passed; 2 mutations caught, teeth confirmed); consolidated 5 held-out tests into committed module; updated OVERLAY_IDS closed-set drift guard (test_code_review_recommend_overlays); broad sweep 1439 passed; make lint+typecheck clean. Committing stacked on S3 (1960).","timestamp":1787261014002464001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 committed (acd547b712) and pushed to Gerrit change 1966, stacked on 1960 (S3). Trailers verified: rebar-ticket bd21-f725-0030-47ef, Change-Id I972c560a, DCO. Awaiting LLM-Review+1 and Verified+1. Proceeding to S4 (ironfisted-humble-shrew) while gates run.","timestamp":1787261081376647001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S4 (ironfisted-humble-shrew) claimed after plan-review BLOCK->fix->PASS. BLOCK caught (independently confirmed) that coverage_threshold is run-success not pass-rate, so a gating recall miss on R3 fails the epoch. Fixed the plan: R3 is now a NON-GATING documented stretch (commented hunk, not scored); scored set = R1,R2 recall + F1,F2,F3 no-fire; tolerance grounded in at_least(2)/epochs 3. Spec authored, prompt-eval VALID exit0, strict discipline gate (test_eval_scorers) 24 passed, all structural ACs met, make lint clean. Committing stacked on S2 (1966).","timestamp":1787262042907430001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S4 committed (dab7445688) + pushed to Gerrit change 1967, stacked on S2 (1966). S1(1959)/S3(1960) already MERGED to main. Awaiting gates on S2(1966) and S4(1967). S5 blocked until S2 closes.","timestamp":1787262082749831001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (1966) reached LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1 (CI green). Checked 7 AC boxes; running completion-verifier close. S4 (1967) now LLM-Review+1, Verified still running.","timestamp":1787262986147173001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 plan-review BLOCKED: concurrency not in OVERLAY_IDS on origin/main because S2's code change (1966) was Verified+1 but unmerged (only board-closed). Applied early-land exception (regression-safe: advisory blocking-disabled overlay, all gates green, CI passed on merge result) — submitted 1966 -> MERGED. Also measured real two-tier fire rates (13.3% committed / +22.0% noisy over 300 commits) and cited them with reproducible method in the S5 plan+docs. Re-running S5 plan-review.","timestamp":1787263965439000001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 claimed (plan-review certified at new main sha 277ca1b7, signed). RED-first: appended 2 config-effect tests to test_code_review_triggers.py — both FAIL correctly (KeyError concurrency; index.lock does not fire under committed-only routing). Now adding the dogfood code_review.concurrency entry to .rebar/criteria_routing.json to go GREEN. Also S4 (1967) reached LLM+1/Verified+1 and was CLOSED via completion-verifier.","timestamp":1787264535795241001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 GREEN: added code_review.concurrency dogfood entry to .rebar/criteria_routing.json (noisy trigger_tokens + applies_to), 2 config-effect tests pass, teeth confirmed via index.lock mutation. Added 'Project dogfood: concurrency trigger tiers' docs section to docs/llm-framework.md (fixed sync.Mutex->sync.WaitGroup to match real committed tokens). make lint + typecheck exit 0; trigger+recommend suites 32 passed. Committed 5877d928f8 (rebar-ticket 5756), pushed -> Gerrit change 1968 stacked on 1967. Awaiting S5 gates.","timestamp":1787264665447525001}],"created_at":1787253472161702001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"67047d6a-4fbd-483a-a3a1-6c918a7ede8f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"292f-57d1-e554-486f"},{"link_uuid":"49b5f0b4-481a-4651-a407-d94c5b81956e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bd21-f725-0030-47ef"},{"link_uuid":"5e27d7ce-1385-4d31-8488-3bc54c764bbc","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c134-2158-ea8a-49f1"},{"link_uuid":"d795b1b7-e9c3-4e7c-b1a0-1a1031b39339","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"5756-ef1a-68ab-4ba4"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","292f-57d1-e554-486f"],["relates_to","5756-ef1a-68ab-4ba4"],["relates_to","bd21-f725-0030-47ef"],["relates_to","c134-2158-ea8a-49f1"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"eb1c-3ca4-34f8-4cfb","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement spoiled-theatrical-parrot: concurrency code-review overlay","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0131aeaa-58f4-4450-811a-d547dacbe8a7","75b17a24-9a60-4f32-8a11-5aa76614956b","926474e2-6f4a-4873-8fb2-8158cab43388","49b5f0b4-481a-4651-a407-d94c5b81956e","42bbb139-94df-441d-84a6-c5982862ad30","b4d9c557-116a-4aaa-ab89-7b67c1cbc14f","5e27d7ce-1385-4d31-8488-3bc54